threshold (not 25 mmHg) |

**KEY EXCLUSION CRITERIA APPLIED:**
1. Wrong reference standard threshold (studies 65, 66, 77 used 20 or 45 mmHg instead of 25 mmHg)
2. Wrong primary outcome (studies 62, 69 focused on PVR or diastolic dysfunction)
3. No RHC reference standard (study 71)
