tool to format the mini-batch, then make decisions based on the selection criteria.                                     
                                                                                                                        
Key selection criteria:                                                                                                 
1. Diagnostic accuracy of trans-thoracic Doppler echocardiography for detecting PH                                      
2. Right-heart catheterization as reference standard                                                                    
3. Reference standard threshold = 25 mmHg (mean PAP ≥ 25 mmHg)                                                          
4. Must provide TP, FP, TN, FN data (or extractable)                                                                    
5. Exclude two-gate/case-control designs                                                                                
6. Be CONSERVATIVE: include when uncertain                                                                              
                                                                                                                        
