standard threshold differed from 25 mmHg. We also excluded studies that did not provide sufficient diagnostic test 
accuracy data (true‐positive [TP], false‐positive [FP], true‐negative [TN], and false‐negative [FN] values, based on the
reference standard). We included studies that provided data from which we could extract TP, FP, TN, and FN values, based
