**Conservative Screening Approach:**
- Studies with incomplete abstracts (146, 155) were INCLUDED pending full-text review
- Studies where TP/FP/TN/FN data might be extractable from full text (142, 151, 152) were INCLUDED
- Only studies clearly not meeting criteria were excluded

**Population Considerations:**
